# The flashlight's live bounce (rsm): Joep's F4 of the white block in room 3,
# lamps off; room 2's ceiling without the old uplight; the bounce must not
# reach through a wall (room 3's ceiling by room 2, pendant on, lamps off).
r3_flash_box   0.0,1.65,-11.9            0.0        -0.17      0000 0 1 840,470,240,135
